{"sec": "sec:Summary: Core Principles", "blocks": [{"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/1", "kind": "item", "range": [19145, 19278], "text": "A workflow is how you operate. It is the steps you actually take, whether or not\n   you wrote them down, and everyone has one.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "A workflow is how you operate.", "words": ["A", "workflow", "is", "how", "you", "operate"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "It is the steps you actually take, whether or not\n   you wrote them down, and everyone has one.", "words": ["It", "is", "the", "steps", "you", "actually", "take", "whether", "or", "not", "you", "wrote", "them", "down", "and", "everyone", "has", "one"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/1.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/1.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/1.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/1.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/1.1.4", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/1.1.5", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/1.1.6"]}], "uid": "aw:b70"}, {"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/2", "kind": "item", "range": [19279, 19400], "text": "The workflow decides which questions are cheap, and over time that decides what you\n   notice about your own work.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "The workflow decides which questions are cheap, and over time that decides what you\n   notice about your own work.", "words": ["The", "workflow", "decides", "which", "questions", "are", "cheap", "and", "over", "time", "that", "decides", "what", "you", "notice", "about", "your", "own", "work"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/2.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/2.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/2.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/2.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/2.1.4", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/2.1.5", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/2.1.6", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/2.1.7"]}], "uid": "aw:b71"}, {"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/3", "kind": "item", "range": [19401, 19516], "text": "Four things a workflow can now change: the tooling, the visualisation, the\n   comprehension and the context.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "Four things a workflow can now change: the tooling, the visualisation, the\n   comprehension and the context.", "words": ["Four", "things", "a", "workflow", "can", "now", "change", "the", "tooling", "the", "visualisation", "the", "comprehension", "and", "the", "context"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/3.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/3.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/3.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/3.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/3.1.4", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/3.1.5", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/3.1.6", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/3.1.7"]}], "uid": "aw:b72"}, {"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/4", "kind": "item", "range": [19517, 19654], "text": "The purpose is the zone. A workflow earns its keep by removing interruptions, and\n   any step that adds one has to pay for itself.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "The purpose is the zone.", "words": ["The", "purpose", "is", "the", "zone"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "A workflow earns its keep by removing interruptions, and\n   any step that adds one has to pay for itself.", "words": ["A", "workflow", "earns", "its", "keep", "by", "removing", "interruptions", "and", "any", "step", "that", "adds", "one", "has", "to", "pay", "for", "itself"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/4.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/4.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/4.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/4.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/4.1.4", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/4.1.5"]}], "uid": "aw:b73"}, {"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/5", "kind": "item", "range": [19655, 19779], "text": "Villager and explorer are phases, not people. Consuming and improving are two modes\n   the same person moves between.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "Villager and explorer are phases, not people.", "words": ["Villager", "and", "explorer", "are", "phases", "not", "people"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "Consuming and improving are two modes\n   the same person moves between.", "words": ["Consuming", "and", "improving", "are", "two", "modes", "the", "same", "person", "moves", "between"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/5.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/5.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/5.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/5.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/5.1.4", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/5.1.5", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/5.1.6", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/5.1.7"]}], "uid": "aw:b74"}, {"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/6", "kind": "item", "range": [19780, 19937], "text": "Experience changes reach, not route. The steps are the same; skill decides how deep\n   into the workflow you can change things, and how fast you read.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "Experience changes reach, not route.", "words": ["Experience", "changes", "reach", "not", "route"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "The steps are the same; skill decides how deep\n   into the workflow you can change things, and how fast you read.", "words": ["The", "steps", "are", "the", "same", "skill", "decides", "how", "deep", "into", "the", "workflow", "you", "can", "change", "things", "and", "how", "fast", "you", "read"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/6.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/6.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/6.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/6.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/6.1.4", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/6.1.5"]}], "uid": "aw:b75"}, {"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/7", "kind": "item", "range": [19938, 20038], "text": "The explorer trigger is a manual step, noticed. The default is not to change the\n   workflow.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "The explorer trigger is a manual step, noticed.", "words": ["The", "explorer", "trigger", "is", "a", "manual", "step", "noticed"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "The default is not to change the\n   workflow.", "words": ["The", "default", "is", "not", "to", "change", "the", "workflow"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/7.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/7.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/7.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/7.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/7.1.4", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/7.1.5", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/7.1.6", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/7.1.7"]}], "uid": "aw:b76"}, {"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/8", "kind": "item", "range": [20039, 20145], "text": "Detours are bounded by payback. Hours or days is a tooling detour; years is a\n   different project.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "Detours are bounded by payback.", "words": ["Detours", "are", "bounded", "by", "payback"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "Hours or days is a tooling detour; years is a\n   different project.", "words": ["Hours", "or", "days", "is", "a", "tooling", "detour", "years", "is", "a", "different", "project"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/8.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/8.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/8.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/8.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/8.1.4", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/8.1.5"]}], "uid": "aw:b77"}, {"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/9", "kind": "item", "range": [20146, 20282], "text": "Maturity is measured by not changing it. A workflow that survived real work\n   untouched is a workflow that has been productised.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "Maturity is measured by not changing it.", "words": ["Maturity", "is", "measured", "by", "not", "changing", "it"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "A workflow that survived real work\n   untouched is a workflow that has been productised.", "words": ["A", "workflow", "that", "survived", "real", "work", "untouched", "is", "a", "workflow", "that", "has", "been", "productised"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/9.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/9.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/9.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/9.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/9.1.4", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/9.1.5", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/9.1.6", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/9.1.7"]}], "uid": "aw:b78"}, {"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/10", "kind": "item", "range": [20283, 20368], "text": "Parked is not abandoned. A stop with a reason and reusable parts is a result.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "Parked is not abandoned.", "words": ["Parked", "is", "not", "abandoned"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "A stop with a reason and reusable parts is a result.", "words": ["A", "stop", "with", "a", "reason", "and", "reusable", "parts", "is", "a", "result"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/10.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/10.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/10.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/10.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/10.1.4"]}], "uid": "aw:b79"}, {"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/11", "kind": "item", "range": [20369, 20477], "text": "Projections come from sources plus transformations, and sources stay in the\n    deterministic layer.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "Projections come from sources plus transformations, and sources stay in the\n    deterministic layer.", "words": ["Projections", "come", "from", "sources", "plus", "transformations", "and", "sources", "stay", "in", "the", "deterministic", "layer"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/11.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/11.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/11.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/11.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/11.1.4", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/11.1.5", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/11.1.6"]}], "uid": "aw:b80"}, {"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/12", "kind": "item", "range": [20478, 20588], "text": "Interpretation is a one-way door. Put it as late in the chain as possible and\n    declare where it is.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "Interpretation is a one-way door.", "words": ["Interpretation", "is", "a", "one-way", "door"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "Put it as late in the chain as possible and\n    declare where it is.", "words": ["Put", "it", "as", "late", "in", "the", "chain", "as", "possible", "and", "declare", "where", "it", "is"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/12.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/12.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/12.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/12.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/12.1.4", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/12.1.5"]}], "uid": "aw:b81"}, {"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/13", "kind": "item", "range": [20589, 20686], "text": "Everything gets a folder, and the test of the folder is whether it can be lifted\n    out.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "Everything gets a folder, and the test of the folder is whether it can be lifted\n    out.", "words": ["Everything", "gets", "a", "folder", "and", "the", "test", "of", "the", "folder", "is", "whether", "it", "can", "be", "lifted", "out"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/13.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/13.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/13.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/13.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/13.1.4"]}], "uid": "aw:b82"}, {"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/14", "kind": "item", "range": [20687, 20771], "text": "A named process is repeatable. Naming is the cheapest improvement available.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "A named process is repeatable.", "words": ["A", "named", "process", "is", "repeatable"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "Naming is the cheapest improvement available.", "words": ["Naming", "is", "the", "cheapest", "improvement", "available"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/14.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/14.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/14.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/14.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/14.1.4", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/14.1.5"]}], "uid": "aw:b83"}, {"id": "blk:Summary: Core Principles/15", "kind": "item", "range": [20772, 20909], "text": "A diff is a step, not a feature. Diff the graphs, not the markdown, and formatting\n    changes become findings rather than noise.", "sentences": [{"n": 1, "text": "A diff is a step, not a feature.", "words": ["A", "diff", "is", "a", "step", "not", "a", "feature"]}, {"n": 2, "text": "Diff the graphs, not the markdown, and formatting\n    changes become findings rather than noise.", "words": ["Diff", "the", "graphs", "not", "the", "markdown", "and", "formatting", "changes", "become", "findings", "rather", "than", "noise"]}], "spans": [{"id": "mk:Summary: Core Principles/15.1", "kind": "bold", "covers": ["wrd:Summary: Core Principles/15.1.1", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/15.1.2", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/15.1.3", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/15.1.4", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/15.1.5", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/15.1.6", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/15.1.7", "wrd:Summary: Core Principles/15.1.8"]}], "uid": "aw:b84"}]}
